{"step_index":3551,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:02:29Z","content":"Now I see the full architecture. The existing stage has Three.js with a wireframe icosahedron core and 8 orbital nodes. I'll build the custom floating orb physics engine directly into a new page on the Sovereign Stage — live telemetry-driven orbs with real WebGL glow, motion physics, and agent state mapping.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>XORAS Sovereign Orb Engine — Live Agent Telemetry</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body, html {\n            width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden;\n            background: #020408;\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n            user-select: none;\n        }\n        canvas { display: block; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; }\n\n        /* HUD Overlay */\n        .hud {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n            pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .hud-title {\n            position: absolute; top: 24px; left: 32px;\n            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px;\n            color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase;\n            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .hud-title .dot {\n            width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;\n            background: #00F2FE; box-shadow: 0 0 12px #00F2FE;\n            animation: pulse 1.6s infinite ease-in-out;\n        }\n        @keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); } }\n\n        .hud-root {\n            position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 32px;\n            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n            color: #10B981; font-family: \"SF Mono\", \"Fira Code\", monospace;\n        }\n        .hud-agents {\n            position: absolute; bottom: 28px; left: 50%;\n            transform: translateX(-50%);\n            display: flex; gap: 32px;\n        }\n        .agent-card {\n            text-align: center; min-width: 100px;\n        }\n        .agent-card .name {\n            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n        .agent-card .status {\n            font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; color: #64748B;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .agent-card .status.active { color: #38BDF8; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(56,189,248,0.6); }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <canvas id=\"orbCanvas\"></canvas>\n\n    <div class=\"hud\">\n        <div class=\"hud-title\">\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            XORAS SOVEREIGN ORB ENGINE\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hud-root\" id=\"merkleRoot\">ROOT: loading...</div>\n        <div class=\"hud-agents\" id=\"agentCards\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n    // =========================================================================\n    // XORAS CUSTOM ORB PHYSICS ENGINE — WebGL + Custom Particle System\n    // No third-party physics. No market library. Pure sovereign code.\n    // =========================================================================\n\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('orbCanvas');\n    const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl2') || canvas.getContext('webgl');\n    if (!gl) { document.body.innerHTML = '<h1 style=\"color:#fff;padding:40px\">WebGL not supported</h1>'; }\n\n    // --- Agents State ---\n    const AGENTS = [\n        { id: 'maxx',  name: 'MAXX',  role: 'LEAD',   color: [0.0, 0.95, 1.0],  glow: 1.0, activity: 1.0, lastBeat: Date.now(), speaking: false },\n        { id: 'vance', name: 'VANCE', role: 'CRITIC', color: [1.0, 0.35, 0.2],  glow: 1.0, activity: 1.0, lastBeat: Date.now(), speaking: false },\n        { id: 'eden',  name: 'EDEN',  role: 'HUMAN',  color: [0.4, 1.0, 0.55],  glow: 1.0, activity: 1.0, lastBeat: Date.now(), speaking: false },\n    ];\n\n    // --- Resize ---\n    let W, H, dpr;\n    function resize() {\n        dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2);\n        W = window.innerWidth; H = window.innerHeight;\n        canvas.width = W * dpr; canvas.height = H * dpr;\n        canvas.style.width = W + 'px'; canvas.style.height = H + 'px';\n        gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n    }\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n    resize();\n\n    // --- Shader Compilation ---\n    function compileShader(src, type) {\n        const s = gl.createShader(type);\n        gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n        gl.compileShader(s);\n        if (!gl.getShaderParameter(s, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) {\n            console.error(gl.getShaderInfoLog(s)); gl.deleteShader(s); return null;\n        }\n        return s;\n    }\n    function createProgram(vsSrc, fsSrc) {\n        const p = gl.createProgram();\n        gl.attachShader(p, compileShader(vsSrc, gl.VERTEX_SHADER));\n        gl.attachShader(p, compileShader(fsSrc, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER));\n        gl.linkProgram(p);\n        if (!gl.getProgramParameter(p, gl.LINK_STATUS)) {\n            console.error(gl.getProgramInfoLog(p)); return null;\n        }\n        return p;\n    }\n\n    // --- Orb Vertex Shader ---\n    const orbVS = `\n        attribute vec2 aPos;\n        varying vec2 vUV;\n        uniform vec2 uCenter;\n        uniform float uRadius;\n        uniform float uAspect;\n        void main() {\n            vUV = aPos;\n            vec2 pos = uCenter + aPos * uRadius * vec2(1.0 / uAspect, 1.0);\n            gl_Position = vec4(pos, 0.0, 1.0);\n        }\n    `;\n\n    // --- Orb Fragment Shader — Custom Glow Physics ---\n    const orbFS = `\n        precision highp float;\n        varying vec2 vUV;\n        uniform vec3 uColor;\n        uniform float uGlow;\n        uniform float uTime;\n        uniform float uActivity;\n\n        void main() {\n            float dist = length(vUV);\n\n            // Core solid sphere\n            float core = smoothstep(0.35, 0.28, dist);\n\n            // Inner glow — exponential falloff\n            float inner = exp(-dist * 3.5) * 0.8;\n\n            // Outer halo — wide soft bloom\n            float outer = exp(-dist * 1.8) * 0.3;\n\n            // Pulsing breathe effect tied to activity\n            float breathe = 1.0 + sin(uTime * 2.5 + uActivity * 6.28) * 0.12 * uGlow;\n\n            // Shimmer — high frequency sparkle on the surface\n            float shimmer = sin(uTime * 12.0 + vUV.x * 40.0) * sin(uTime * 9.0 + vUV.y * 40.0);\n            shimmer = shimmer * 0.04 * smoothstep(0.5, 0.25, dist);\n\n            float intensity = (core + inner + outer) * breathe * uGlow + shimmer;\n\n            // Color grade: brighter core, tinted halo\n            vec3 col = uColor * intensity;\n            col += vec3(1.0) * core * 0.3 * uGlow; // white-hot center\n\n            // Ambient particle dust ring\n            float ring = smoothstep(0.52, 0.48, dist) * smoothstep(0.38, 0.42, dist);\n            float ringPulse = sin(uTime * 4.0 + atan(vUV.y, vUV.x) * 8.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n            col += uColor * ring * ringPulse * 0.15;\n\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(col, intensity * 0.95);\n        }\n    `;\n\n    // --- Background Star Field Shader ---\n    const starVS = `\n        attribute vec2 aPos;\n        attribute float aSize;\n        attribute float aBright;\n        uniform float uTime;\n        varying float vBright;\n        void main() {\n            vBright = aBright * (0.6 + 0.4 * sin(uTime * 1.5 + aPos.x * 100.0));\n            gl_Position = vec4(aPos, 0.0, 1.0);\n            gl_PointSize = aSize;\n        }\n    `;\n    const starFS = `\n        precision highp float;\n        varying float vBright;\n        void main() {\n            float d = length(gl_PointCoord - 0.5) * 2.0;\n            float a = smoothstep(1.0, 0.0, d) * vBright;\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(0.7, 0.85, 1.0, a * 0.6);\n        }\n    `;\n\n    // --- Connection Line Shader ---\n    const lineVS = `\n        attribute vec2 aPos;\n        uniform float uAlpha;\n        varying float vAlpha;\n        void main() {\n            vAlpha = uAlpha;\n            gl_Position = vec4(aPos, 0.0, 1.0);\n        }\n    `;\n    const lineFS = `\n        precision highp float;\n        varying float vAlpha;\n        uniform vec3 uColor;\n        void main() {\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(uColor, vAlpha * 0.25);\n        }\n    `;\n\n    // --- Build Programs ---\n    const orbProg = createProgram(orbVS, orbFS);\n    const starProg = createProgram(starVS, starFS);\n    const lineProg = createProgram(lineVS, lineFS);\n\n    // --- Orb Quad Geometry ---\n    const quadVerts = new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]);\n    const quadBuf = gl.createBuffer();\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\n    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadVerts, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n    // --- Star Field Geometry ---\n    const STAR_COUNT = 600;\n    const starData = new Float32Array(STAR_COUNT * 4); // x, y, size, brightness\n    for (let i = 0; i < STAR_COUNT; i++) {\n        starData[i*4+0] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.0;\n        starData[i*4+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.0;\n        starData[i*4+2] = Math.random() * 2.5 + 0.5;\n        starData[i*4+3] = Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.2;\n    }\n    const starBuf = gl.createBuffer();\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, starBuf);\n    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, starData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n    // --- Connection Line Buffer ---\n    const lineBuf = gl.createBuffer();\n\n    // --- Orb Physics State ---\n    class OrbPhysics {\n        constructor(agent, idx, total) {\n            this.agent = agent;\n            this.angle = (idx / total) * Math.PI * 2 - Math.PI / 2;\n            this.orbitRadius = 0.38;\n            this.x = Math.cos(this.angle) * this.orbitRadius;\n            this.y = Math.sin(this.angle) * this.orbitRadius;\n            this.vx = 0; this.vy = 0;\n            this.baseAngle = this.angle;\n            this.wobblePhase = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n            this.driftSpeed = 0.15 + Math.random() * 0.1;\n        }\n\n        update(t, dt) {\n            // Orbital drift — continuous slow revolution\n            this.angle = this.baseAngle + t * this.driftSpeed;\n\n            // Activity-responsive orbit radius\n            const silenceSec = (Date.now() - this.agent.lastBeat) / 1000;\n            const activityDecay = Math.max(0.15, 1.0 - silenceSec / 60);\n            this.agent.activity = activityDecay;\n\n            // Wobble — organic floating feel\n            const wobbleX = Math.sin(t * 1.3 + this.wobblePhase) * 0.025;\n            const wobbleY = Math.cos(t * 1.7 + this.wobblePhase * 1.3) * 0.02;\n\n            // Target position on orbit\n            const targetR = this.orbitRadius * (0.85 + activityDecay * 0.15);\n            const tx = Math.cos(this.angle) * targetR + wobbleX;\n            const ty = Math.sin(this.angle) * targetR + wobbleY;\n\n            // Spring physics — smooth elastic snap\n            const spring = 2.5;\n            const damping = 0.92;\n            this.vx += (tx - this.x) * spring * dt;\n            this.vy += (ty - this.y) * spring * dt;\n            this.vx *= damping;\n            this.vy *= damping;\n            this.x += this.vx * dt;\n            this.y += this.vy * dt;\n\n            // Glow follows activity\n            this.agent.glow = 0.3 + activityDecay * 0.7;\n        }\n    }\n\n    const orbs = AGENTS.map((a, i) => new OrbPhysics(a, i, AGENTS.length));\n\n    // --- HUD Setup ---\n    const agentCardsEl = document.getElementById('agentCards');\n    AGENTS.forEach(a => {\n        const card = document.createElement('div');\n        card.className = 'agent-card';\n        card.id = 'card-' + a.id;\n        card.innerHTML = `\n            <div class=\"name\" style=\"color: rgb(${a.color.map(c=>Math.round(c*255)).join(',')})\">${a.name}</div>\n            <div class=\"status\" id=\"status-${a.id}\">${a.role}</div>\n        `;\n        agentCardsEl.appendChild(card);\n    });\n\n    // --- Telemetry Fetch ---\n    let merkleRoot = '—';\n    async function fetchTelemetry() {\n        try {\n            const res = await fetch('/api/telemetry');\n            if (res.ok) {\n                const data = await res.json();\n                if (data.merkle_root) merkleRoot = data.merkle_root;\n            }\n        } catch(e) {}\n\n        // Check quorum activity log for agent heartbeats\n        try {\n            const res = await fetch('/api/quorum_activity');\n            if (res.ok) {\n                const data = await res.json();\n                if (data.agents) {\n                    data.agents.forEach(entry => {\n                        const agent = AGENTS.find(a => a.id === entry.id);\n                        if (agent && entry.lastBeat) {\n                            agent.lastBeat = entry.lastBeat;\n                            agent.speaking = entry.speaking || false;\n                        }\n                    });\n                }\n            }\n        } catch(e) {}\n\n        document.getElementById('merkleRoot').textContent = 'ROOT: ' + (merkleRoot || '—').substring(0, 16) + '...';\n    }\n    setInterval(fetchTelemetry, 3000);\n    fetchTelemetry();\n\n    // --- Render Loop ---\n    let startTime = performance.now() / 1000;\n    let lastFrame = startTime;\n\n    function render() {\n        requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        const now = performance.now() / 1000;\n        const t = now - startTime;\n        const dt = Math.min(now - lastFrame, 0.05);\n        lastFrame = now;\n\n        const aspect = W / H;\n\n        // Update physics\n        orbs.forEach(o => o.update(t, dt));\n\n        // Clear\n        gl.clearColor(0.008, 0.016, 0.032, 1.0);\n        gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n        gl.enable(gl.BLEND);\n        gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA, gl.ONE);\n\n        // --- Draw Stars ---\n        gl.useProgram(starProg);\n        gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, starBuf);\n        const saPosLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(starProg, 'aPos');\n        const saSizeLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(starProg, 'aSize');\n        const saBrightLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(starProg, 'aBright');\n        gl.enableVertexAttribArray(saPosLoc);\n        gl.enableVertexAttribArray(saSizeLoc);\n        gl.enableVertexAttribArray(saBrightLoc);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(saPosLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 16, 0);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(saSizeLoc, 1, gl.FLOAT, false, 16, 8);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(saBrightLoc, 1, gl.FLOAT, false, 16, 12);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(starProg, 'uTime'), t);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.POINTS, 0, STAR_COUNT);\n        gl.disableVertexAttribArray(saSizeLoc);\n        gl.disableVertexAttribArray(saBrightLoc);\n\n        // --- Draw Connection Lines ---\n        gl.useProgram(lineProg);\n        for (let i = 0; i < orbs.length; i++) {\n            for (let j = i + 1; j < orbs.length; j++) {\n                const a = orbs[i], b = orbs[j];\n                const lineVerts = new Float32Array([a.x, a.y, b.x, b.y]);\n                gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, lineBuf);\n                gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, lineVerts, gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n                const lPosLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(lineProg, 'aPos');\n                gl.enableVertexAttribArray(lPosLoc);\n                gl.vertexAttribPointer(lPosLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n                const avgGlow = (a.agent.glow + b.agent.glow) / 2;\n                const mixColor = a.agent.color.map((c, idx) => (c + b.agent.color[idx]) / 2);\n                gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(lineProg, 'uAlpha'), avgGlow);\n                gl.uniform3fv(gl.getUniformLocation(lineProg, 'uColor'), mixColor);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.LINES, 0, 2);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // --- Draw Orbs ---\n        gl.useProgram(orbProg);\n        gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\n        const oPosLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(orbProg, 'aPos');\n        gl.enableVertexAttribArray(oPosLoc);\n        gl.vertexAttribPointer(oPosLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n        orbs.forEach(o => {\n            gl.uniform2f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uCenter'), o.x, o.y);\n            gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uRadius'), 0.14 + o.agent.glow * 0.04);\n            gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uAspect'), aspect);\n            gl.uniform3fv(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uColor'), o.agent.color);\n            gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uGlow'), o.agent.glow);\n            gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uTime'), t);\n            gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(orbProg, 'uActivity'), o.agent.activity);\n            gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n        });\n\n        // --- Update HUD ---\n        AGENTS.forEach(a => {\n            const statusEl = document.getElementById('status-' + a.id);\n            if (statusEl) {\n                const silenceSec = (Date.now() - a.lastBeat) / 1000;\n                if (a.speaking) {\n                    statusEl.textContent = '● SPEAKING';\n                    statusEl.className = 'status active';\n                } else if (silenceSec < 30) {\n                    statusEl.textContent = a.role + ' — ACTIVE';\n                    statusEl.className = 'status active';\n                } else {\n                    statusEl.textContent = a.role + ' — IDLE ' + Math.floor(silenceSec) + 's';\n                    statusEl.className = 'status';\n                }\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    render();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Custom WebGL orb physics engine with live agent telemetry — no market library, pure sovereign code. Spring physics, orbital drift, glow shaders, particle dust rings, star field, connection lines.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/fullscreen_ui/sovereign_orbs.html","toolAction":"Creating sovereign_orbs.html WebGL engine","toolSummary":"Write custom WebGL orb physics engine"}}]}
